    <!-- Troubleshooting Guide -->
    <string name="faq_q1">Printer not detected</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">1. Ensure OTG cable is securely connected.\n2. Verify printer power switch is ON.\n3. Enable OTG in Android system settings if needed.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Output page is completely blank</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">1. Check if toner cartridge protective tape was removed.\n2. Ensure printer drum rotates smoothly.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">Paper jams or multiple sheets feed</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">1. Do not overload input tray.\n2. Clean rubber roller with a slightly damp cloth.\n3. Enable \'Step-by-step Print\' in print settings.</string>

